    <nav class={runIndex} aria-label="Measurement runs">
      <a class={runLink} href="#cold-heading"><span class={label}>01 / cold</span><strong class={number}>0.38 s</strong><h3 class={cardTitle}>From process start</h3><p class={cardText}>21 fixtures through one Node harness.</p><span class={jumpCue}>See the cold run</span></a>
      <a class={runLink} href="#installed-heading"><span class={label}>02 / installed</span><strong class={number}>28×</strong><h3 class={cardTitle}>RDT median</h3><p class={cardText}>Five public repos with package types.</p><span class={jumpCue}>See the library run</span></a>
      <a class={runLink} href="#dev-heading"><span class={label}>03 / dev mode</span><strong class={number}>4 ms</strong><h3 class={cardTitle}>Median request</h3><p class={cardText}>129 real Spectrum stories in source.</p><span class={jumpCue}>See the dev run</span></a>
    </nav>
  </PageSection>

  <PageSection id="protocol-heading" label="the setup" title="A comparison you can inspect" description="We fix the inputs, state what each tool reads and show where the timer starts and stops.">

